<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sets dollar sell tender in floating market.</title>
<headline>Brazil sets dollar sell tender in floating market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's central bank announced a dollar sell tender in the interbank foreign exchange floating rate market, dealers said.</p>
<p>The real was quoted at 1.0212 per dollar before the central bank announced the auction, they added.</p>
<p>-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo Newsroom 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
